Description: Linux desktop GUI for Subversion working copy operations
 SVN Client provides a graphical interface for developers working with
 Subversion (SVN) version-controlled projects on Linux.
 .
 Features include:
  - Working copy status browser with coloured status indicators
  - Unified and side-by-side diff viewer with syntax highlighting
  - Paginated commit log with full-text search
  - Checkout, update, commit, revert, and branch/tag operations
  - Three-way conflict resolution panel
  - Credential storage via system keyring (SecretService / KWallet)
